0001  @RUN   ALBANY,76104,CS301,1,20
0002  @APL,I
UNIVERSITY OF MARYLAND APL
CLEAR WS
0003  $CM SOLVE A+.$MUX = B WITH DOMINO
      ⍝ SOLVE A+.×X = B WITH DOMINO
0004  A $AL 2 2 $RH 2 1 1 3
      A ← 2 2 ⍴ 2 1 1 3
0005  B $AL 5 10
      B ← 5 10
0006  X $AL B $DM A
      X ← B ⌹ A
0007  $QD $AL X
      ⎕ ← X
1 3
0008  A+.$MU X
      A+.× X
5 10
0009  @FIN
END OF RUN
